WEBVTT

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.477
At a fundraiser, every guest
comes through the same door.

00:00:03.500 --> 00:00:05.037
What happens next matters.

00:00:05.060 --> 00:00:07.137
We help your foundation
plan the welcome,

00:00:07.160 --> 00:00:10.610
coordinate sponsors and volunteers,
and run the day.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.257
When we produce your fundraiser,

00:00:12.280 --> 00:00:14.037
our digital event
and logistics system

00:00:14.060 --> 00:00:16.730
is included at no additional cost.

00:00:16.760 --> 00:00:18.670
Manage registration and check-in.

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:20.790
Track donations
and sponsor commitments.

00:00:20.860 --> 00:00:22.890
Give volunteers clear assignments.

00:00:22.940 --> 00:00:26.030
Your foundation can keep using
the system for future events.

00:00:26.300 --> 00:00:28.217
Cause on Cue starts
with a conversation.

00:00:28.240 --> 00:00:30.300
Tell us about your next fundraiser.
